<title>BELGIUM: SOCCER-BELGIAN LEAGUE CHAMPIONS SINCE 1946.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BELGIAN LEAGUE CHAMPIONS SINCE 1946.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-05-25</dateline>
<text>
