<p>		     Champions		 Runners-up</p>
<p> 1945-46	   Mechelen		  Antwerp</p>
<p> 1946-47	   Anderlecht		Olympic Charleroi</p>
<p> 1947-48	   Mechelen		  Anderlecht</p>
