<p>The league began in 1896. The following clubs have won the</p>
<p>title:</p>
<p>24 - Anderlecht</p>
<p>11 - Union Saint-Gilloise</p>
<p>10 - Club Brugge</p>
<p>8 - Standard Liege</p>
